|  After everything previously described, it will come as no surprise
|  that family court judges sometimes use name-calling as another way
|  of attacking protective mothers. Vindictive, malicious, neurotic,
|  paranoid, and mentally ill are all labels we have found in the mouths
.  of family court judges as they describe protective mothers


--- Sentence/switch
