|  Guyanese Mother’s Painful Odyssey in the Domestic Courts
|  A Nassau County (Long Island), New York, mother, born in Guyana to
|  Indian parents, suffered a painful odyssey in the domestic courts. While
|  her litigation took place in the New York Supreme Court, rather than
|  Family Court, all the elements of her case were tragically representative
